 "description": "<p>A hollow-out star pattern cut into a leather puppy collar, in white or black, adjusting through 40-50 cm. The cutouts are the design - negative space doing what a charm would otherwise do, without the swing.</p>\n<p>Two colorways keep the options simple. The leather holds the cut edges clean, which is what separates a cut pattern from a stamped one at close range.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Item type: collar</li>\n<li>Style: puppy, hollow-out star</li>\n<li>Color: white or black</li>\n<li>Fit: 40-50 cm circumference</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One accessory that reads two ways - the cutout pattern up close, a clean collar at distance. Fits 40-50 cm.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Hollow-out star leather puppy collar in white or black, adjustable 40-50 cm, cutout pattern.</p>\n",
